    "created_at": "2018-03-21T16:15:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-21T16:15:11Z",
    "body": "> is this some kind of global search?\r\n\r\nno. MutationObserver has the list of transient observers, so it can just go through the list.\r\nIn particular in Gecko there is MutationReceiver per observed target internally doing actually observing, and it has list of transient receivers. ",
